# <scope>: <subject>
# │       │
# │       └─⫸ Summary in present tense. No period. (e.g. "fix login button")
# │            DO NOT use conventional-commit prefixes (feat:, fix:, chore:).
# │            Linear ticket numbers belong in PR merge commits, not here.
# │
# └─⫸ CHOOSE ONE SCOPE:
#     web     - Code that involves both Student/Teacher Application
#     student - Code that involves Student Application only
#     teacher - Code that involves Teacher Application only
#     backend - Code that involves backend application
#     api     - API routes, endpoints, request handling
#     admin   - SQLAdmin dashboard (Staff)
#     worker  - Celery tasks, background jobs
#     db      - Migrations, seeds, SQL schemas
#     infra   - Docker, Otel, CI/CD, Cloud config
#     repo    - Root config, README, editor settings
#     deps    - Dependency updates (package.json, pyproject.toml)
#     agent   - AI agent config (AGENTS.md, llms.txt, .agents/ skills)
#
# ---------------------[ BODY ]---------------------
# (Optional) Motivation for the change.
# Explain *why* you made this change, not *how*.
# Wrap lines at 72 characters.
